sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / CI
    participant C as Run Coordinator
    participant T as Task Registry
    participant S as Sandbox
    participant A as Coding Agent
    participant M as LLM
    participant B as Browser
    participant E as Evaluator
    participant R as Result Store

    U->>C: 创建评测 Run
    C->>T: 读取 Task 与 Suite
    T-->>C: Task Bundle + Version
    C->>S: 创建固定环境 Sandbox
    C->>S: 注入公开代码与任务
    C->>S: 只读挂载隐藏 Evaluator
    C->>A: 启动 Agent

    loop Agent 执行
        A->>M: 上下文与工具请求
        M-->>A: Tool Call / Response
        alt 文件操作
            A->>S: Read / Search / Edit
            S-->>A: 文件结果
        else Shell
            A->>S: Install / Test / Build
            S-->>A: stdout / stderr
        else Browser
            A->>B: Open / Click / Input / Inspect
            B-->>A: DOM / Screenshot / Console / Network
        end
    end

    A-->>C: 完成或预算耗尽
    C->>S: 冻结工作区和最终 Patch
    C->>E: 启动验证器流水线
    E->>S: Integrity / Build
    E->>B: Hidden E2E / Visual / A11y
    E->>E: 聚合分项结果
    E->>R: 保存 Result 与 Artifacts
    R-->>C: Run Summary
    C-->>U: 返回结果
